// Conformance fixture for ta.mfi (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.27, Wave 5B-2).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's MFI formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic (close, volume) series (see ta_mfi.csv). No chart
// data is redistributed; the .csv is a pure function of this .pine.
//
// MFI (Money Flow Index) is a volume-weighted RSI variant:
//   * "positive money flow" = volume * source when source > prev_source
//   * "negative money flow" = volume * source when source < prev_source
//   * mfi = 100 - 100 / (1 + upper / lower)  where upper / lower are the
//     length-window sums of positive / negative money flow.
// Warm-up returns NA until bar (length - 1); this fixture uses length=5
// so the first value lands at bar 4.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_mfi", overlay=false)
plot(ta.mfi(close, 5), title="mfi5")
